{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f73276db9303f3cbd3407bda5216396243386dff889ec66ca14009c5b9450d13", "ja": "（劇場のハロウィンイベントが無事に終わった。けど、\n魔女役だった歩が見当たらない。一体どこに……？）", "zh": "（剧场的万圣节活动顺利结束了。可是，\n扮演魔女的步却不见踪影。她到底去哪里了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bee9671ef1dcdb7a5160477da7bc9cfc7e25bcdcbc7039e8e4cb1d7586f5fd2e", "ja": "イエーッ！\nトリックオアトリート！", "zh": "Yeah──！\n不给糖就捣蛋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4f8c0603f0409b0fd5b7054e56264663ec78828daebc4ffde41d1af64cd7838f", "ja": "うわっ。……って、歩、ここにいたのか。", "zh": "哇……咦？步，原来你在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e3d1a1c3180ff50aea291e1dcfc149ce8c863486b55d5fb3d85857af251bc6a", "ja": "へへっ、やったね、サプライズ成功っと！\nどう、ハロウィン気分味わえた？", "zh": "嘿嘿！太好了，惊喜计划成功！\n怎么样？体会到万圣节气氛了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1bb12bb5c715deb19ff32f7861c87392058dcca053fdd015ae3c6ec85d391696", "ja": "いや……どっちかっていうと、\nちょっとビックリしただけかな？", "zh": "这个……真要说的话，\n只是稍微惊讶了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "73ade04cf52a5b473df5da3911c2bce07025edf56d324648c2925a7ddac3baa2", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そっか……。そういえば、\nアタシも脅かすことしか考えてなかったかも。", "zh": "什么！？这、这样啊……\n说起来，我好像也只想着要吓人而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "418b60627f9d8543b69af7a051213b26e2370435f5dd38a80bae02cfa6c19fd7", "ja": "しかも、正直なところ、\nそんなに驚かなかったような……？", "zh": "而且老实说，\n其实我没什么被吓到的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5411a95a92644babe340e8134fcd269b09dca67e37eba0e6200350e8309ef023", "ja": "そうなの！？　なんだよ、も～。\nせっかく着替えないで待ってたのに……。", "zh": "真的假的！？什么嘛～\n害我特地不换掉服装等着吓你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "93bb24aeb29038726916a34210b6fea022eade9990ab948979aa1dfa309373f9", "ja": "そ、そうか……。なんかゴメンな。脅かすなら、\nいっそ部屋の電気を消すとかすればよかったのに。", "zh": "是、是吗……那还真有点过意不去。\n但既然你想吓我，怎么不干脆把房间的灯关掉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "689d29dc70b91f2177d535fb9bc27a79a4c25b48ef93304f2af61091a57515cf", "ja": "そ、そうだけど～。\n真っ暗にしたら……アタシが怖いじゃん。", "zh": "是、是没错啦～\n但要是房间里一片漆黑……我自己会害怕啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "63e033fb3d1c3f105e7547dcc594bff3410f2047494af27613f48290756e4d2e", "ja": "……まあ、そうなるか。", "zh": "……嗯，也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a03445dcd17a86380bed77f50738b59292f136d0fbb0d7374e5f1f2c967a5c5", "ja": "あれ？　でも、そういえば……いつの間にか、\nハロウィン気分になってきた気がするぞ？", "zh": "咦？不过，话说回来……不知不觉之间，\n我好像开始感受到万圣节气氛啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "27a6bcdbbd2e475779dbe2ce96f8d032cc21d6114a159e3c8a0843a0198e410c", "ja": "なんだよ、それ。\nいいよ、無理しなくて。", "zh": "你在说什么啊？\n没关系啦，不用勉强配合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "faa42b3f1464b26760bf425e8c95694ec9bd62f69b888d89898fafc7d49b029e", "ja": "本当だって。ずっと魔女姿のアイドルと\n話していれば、そういう気分にもなるよ。", "zh": "我是说真的。\n跟装扮成魔女的偶像聊着聊着，自然就感觉到啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aef4d71b6ca859640805e7032b2bd8ebee238225d773070582bf1c2c7f4770e4", "ja": "え……？　じゃあ、ホントに？", "zh": "咦……？所以，你是认真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "02167a0a6bce56b95730ab5d2a43158d565523085d90b02870974271693ff1d3", "ja": "ああ、もうすっかりハロウィン気分だ。\nハッピーハロウィーン！　ありがとな、歩！", "zh": "是啊，我已经彻底沉浸在万圣节气氛里了。\n万圣节快乐！谢啦，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1425099c126bf52d0fc3b573eedf9e4abbb3d99b81b0edd7419444a2b7916692", "ja": "あ……あはは、どんな気分だよ、それ！\nま、少しは楽しめたってことなら、いいんだけどさ♪", "zh": "啊……啊哈哈，那是什么怪气氛啦！\n不过，既然你有稍微乐在万圣节当中，那就算了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "201d799aeb1884c3774cdb649006d78342c7fbc5fb698e3585ff33e6c4a5cb34", "ja": "それも、歩の魔女姿が似合ってるからかな。\n今日のお客さんも喜んでたし。お疲れさま！", "zh": "这也是因为步扮起魔女非常适合的关系吧。\n再说今天观众们也看得很开心，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ab7265e54dc3d3151201b76d594fae4a074ecad39a4533137818daf2a62a1e60", "ja": "そ、そっかな？　へへっ、そっか～！\nアタシ、魔女役似合ってたんだ？　よかった～！", "zh": "是、是吗？嘿嘿！这样啊～！\n我很适合扮演魔女吗？太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "83a2232b0f1007d40abc1befa3f37716b3e55640825b663d8366e5f38ed4cecb", "ja": "あ、そうだ。公演で配ったお菓子がまだ残ってるけど、\n劇場のみんなで分けてもいいからな？", "zh": "啊，对了，在公演上发的糖果还有剩，\n可以拿去分给剧场的伙伴们喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b3e45ff3399e15cc6e5145c2133b56b9b6ee693356bbc984dd1937e9eaede50", "ja": "ホント！？　イエーイ！　それじゃあ、ここからは\n劇場のみんなでハロウィンパーティーだね！", "zh": "真的吗！？Yeah！既然如此，\n就去找剧场的伙伴们举办万圣节派对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "35e3e87ec107520089e0ce625bba4d2aedfb59e33e508797c549a0c02adfaf7e", "ja": "お客さんもアタシ達も楽しめたんだから、\nやっぱ、ハロウィンってサイコーだな～♪", "zh": "观众和我们都能玩得这么开心，\n万圣节真的太棒了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0084_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d503d98b65bcfee54e49f64668a3abeb3c454dcb11d2b3d2a3a8e10fbc60efeb", "ja": "あ！　大丈夫、{$P$}のお菓子も、\nちゃんと残しとくって。へへ、早く合流してくれよな！", "zh": "啊！放心吧，{$P$}，\n我会帮你留一份糖果的。嘿嘿，要快点来会合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
